; name: Octagonal post
; group: Rotary axis
; description: Turns a 45 mm square blank on the rotary axis (along Y, Z0 on the axis) into an octagon between square ends: each corner flattened by one pocket in a rotary repeat that turns the blank to 45°, 135°, 225° and 315°. Set side, length and squareEnds; face and cut follow.
; 
